<article class="app-prose app-prose--summary">
    <h2>A calm financial planner for iPhone and iPad</h2>
    <ul>
        {% for highlight in app.highlights %}
        <li>{{ highlight }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p>
        CuratedLedger keeps your ledger on your device. When your device is signed in to iCloud, it also syncs through your own private iCloud database, so your iPhone and iPad stay up to date.
    </p>
    <p>
        Statement import is optional. When you choose a CSV statement from your bank or card provider, CuratedLedger reads it on your device and never uploads it to Curated Design.
    </p>
    <p>
        CuratedLedger has no advertising, tracking, third-party analytics, or Curated Design server, and Curated Design cannot see your financial information. The <a href="/apps/curatedledger/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains this in full.
    </p>
    <p>
        CuratedLedger is a planning tool, not financial advice. Its figures are estimates based on what you enter.
    </p>
</article>
